Significance of Business Finar inance
Every business requires some money to start which is called initial capital. The amount
of capital required depends upon the nature and size of the business.
Adequate finance provides the following benefits to a business concern:
The firm can meet its liabilities on time.
The firm can carry on its business smoothly.
The firm can adopt latest technology and new innovative methods of production.
The firm can make use of its business opportunities.
The firm can face competition more strongly.
The firm can replace its assets and machinery whenever necessary..
The firm can face recession and depression period of trade cycle.
